    <abstract>
      <t>This document defines a YANG data model for Service &amp; Infrastructure
   Maps (SIMAP) Additional Fetaures, including optional graph
   navigation, lifecycle and external-link capabilities intended to be
   reusable with RFC 8345 topology models, including implementations
   using RFC 8795.</t>
